@startuml GetProfileAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
GetProfileAsync – Retrieve Profile by UUID
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "Profile" as prof #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
    profile UUID
end note

requestor -> prof: (profileUuid)
activate prof

prof -> jd: read profile-collection
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct

jd --> prof: profile-collection
deactivate jd

note over prof
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Load profiles from ProfileCollection  
  - Parse the profile list  
  - Find profile where UUID matches profileUuid  
  - Return profile object if found  
  - Return undefined if not found
  
end note

prof --> requestor: Profile Object | undefined
deactivate prof

@enduml
